Grok Build (grok) is SpaceXAI's terminal-based AI coding agent, built from the
experimental openbsd/memeic-typed-memory tree.

This flavor is *not* the stock product package. It enables MemEIC-inspired
"never forget" foundations:

  * typed memory kinds (decision / fact / preference / procedure / episode)
  * compositional retrieval and sectioned injection
  * soft core pins (always-on preferences/decisions across compaction)
  * typed /remember notes and supersede helpers

Use the default (non-flavor) package for production/release builds. Use this
flavor only for memory experiments and evaluation.

Authenticate with "grok login" or set XAI_API_KEY. Per-user state lives under
~/.grok/.
